      "id": 162097,
      "name": "pinbot",
      "username": "pinbot",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/278dde/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-05-11T14:40:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It sure would be nice to get scenarios. &nbsp;I understand you're retooling stuff, and I'm looking forward to see what you come up with. &nbsp;But still, it's rather annoying that you guys moved on to 2 other kickstarters and the pre-order of another wave of tactics stuff when you still have not finished fulfilling the original Tactics campaign. &nbsp;I mean, the maps were paid addons, and if you consider that having good scenarios was an important part of the promise there, arguably more important than the maps for those more interested in scenario play than skirmishing....well it's vexing.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:42:50.755Z",
